    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Beyonders are divided into two factions. Each match lasts <Highlight> 4 minutes </>. The side with the higher score at the end wins. If scores are tied, the number of kills and then damage dealt are compared; the higher side wins. If all are tied, a random side wins. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mechanism Explanation </>\n<Highlight> Score Acquisition: </> Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete. \n<Highlight> Anchor Convergence: </> Anchor points will appear in the match and last for <Highlight> 15 seconds </>. Based on the <Highlight> required number of people </>, enter the anchor point. Once the requirement is met and held for <Highlight> 3 seconds </>, Beyonders of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Beyonders will receive a temporary attribute bonus. \n<Highlight> Vortex of Strife: </> A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight> countdown ends </>, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally. \n<Highlight> Buff Orbs: </> Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield; picking them up grants <Highlight> points and attribute bonuses </>. \n<Highlight> Fate Mushrooms: </> In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Beyonders will drop Fate Mushrooms after dying three consecutive times: allies drop green Fate Mushrooms with Abundance power, which restore health when picked up; enemies drop red Fate Mushrooms with Destruction power, which deduct health when picked up. Please distinguish carefully before picking them up."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Потустороннийs are divided into two factions. Each match lasts <Highlight> 4 minutes </>. The side with the higher score at the end wins. If scores are tied, the number of kills and then damage dealt are compared; the higher side wins. If all are tied, a random side wins. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mechanism Explanation </>\n<Highlight> Score Acquisition: </> Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete. \n<Highlight> Anchor Convergence: </> Anchor points will appear in the match and last for <Highlight> 15 seconds </>. Based on the <Highlight> required number of people </>, enter the anchor point. Once the requirement is met and held for <Highlight> 3 seconds </>, Потустороннийs of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Потустороннийs will receive a temporary attribute bonus. \n<Highlight> Vortex of Strife: </> A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight> countdown ends </>, Потустороннийs remaining in the vortex will split the points equally. \n<Highlight> Buff Orbs: </> Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield; picking them up grants <Highlight> points and attribute bonuses </>. \n<Highlight> Fate Mushrooms: </> In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Потустороннийs will drop Fate Mushrooms after dying three consecutive times: allies drop green Fate Mushrooms with Abundance power, which restore health when picked up; enemies drop red Fate Mushrooms with Destruction power, which deduct health when picked up. Please distinguish carefully before picking them up.",
